meta={'annotation':'Single AI source annotator, not expert-certified; source pages inspected/rendered before any new-project inference. Hough circles assisted coordinates only, no learned detection. Scored ROIs include all visible semantic glyphs under valve/instrument/pump/inlet-outlet convention. Pipe size reducers, rock-trap transparent fitting, disconnected equipment-name oval, meter support bracket are explicit ignore regions, not negatives; text/line IDs are not equipment. Motors are visible instrument bubbles; compound square-with-circle panels are one glyph. Adjacency stops at intermediate semantic equipment. Unmarked four-arm pipe crossings remain separate. Edges may traverse outside ROI where the full source unambiguously shows a common header (Winnipeg2 downstream valves). Branch/dashed subsets overlap and are not independent samples.','selection':'Winkler142/150 and Winnipeg2/7 chosen by source-only process content. Winnipeg7 complex actuator/control boxes were inspected but excluded before inference because internal link boundaries are ambiguous; the scored3-glyph vertical dashed chain is intentionally small. No claim of whole-sheet accuracy. All4 pages and both projects stay test-only.','sheets':sheets}
